{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_04_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_04","title":"我曾舍命为你","storyCode":"HE-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2ad30dbb05f60f3c012dd666077fa3591b1d44cb95261f4c0501d4121c6a98ef","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一点惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我终究背叛了信仰吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因为你的逃避，斯特凡诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你是否是受到了什么外物的影响，如果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有如果，奥卢斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不至于受源石技艺影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时转变我们想法的并不一定是源石技艺。有太多东西足以影响我们，斯特凡诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在劝我重新考虑。为什么，异教的教士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我的决定，难道不是你想要看到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也得承认，在这座了不起的建筑尚在伊比利亚时，我曾有幸在此学习，那段时光对于那时的我来说弥足珍贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特凡诺，在这方面我同你一样。我对这里同样怀有感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得那位和你一起从拉特兰来的修士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得许多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你记得的那个人，在六十年前带上他的铳，决定和当时的国教会共进退，而我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我选择留下，保护剩下的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以此为信念，坚持至今。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你清楚，你仍要我继续等待，继续忍耐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你现在要否认你一直宣扬的那些，转而要我斟酌，劝我坚定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不。斯特凡诺，当然不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，正因我行走在我认为正确的路上，便希望你也如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天早上，如果你仍然坚持，那么我便认为这就是你的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会准备好你需要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还没有想好，我会劝你继续考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论如何......我希望你的决定发自真心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奥卢斯，你弄错了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，如果真是如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么我会欢迎你，斯特凡诺，我新的同胞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"介意我进来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以问一个问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......菲娜她，是不是已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经不在了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果可以的话，我比较希望你能换一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太想骗你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我最开始就有这样的感觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个时候，我忽然就、就感受不到菲娜......明明她那时那么生气，又那么难过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就在我面前啊......？我却哪里都找不到她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果当时，我没帮你修那把铳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别说了，求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我头顶的角，我摸到了。和莱蒙德他们一样的角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然再也没法握着铳祈祷，但至少现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终于，和莱蒙德，和卡洛琳姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终于和大家都一样了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，去年还没这么早开花，今年怎么就这么巧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，好歹算是最后开了一回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就没问题了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g8_outsidepath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚说......有萨科塔堕天？那个女孩叫福尔图娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然出了这样的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堕天......只能回去后由教宗阁下定夺，不是现在我们能够处理的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但闯入我房间的那位不速之客不同。费德里科，有些事我之后再和你解释......现在必须要尽快把那家伙找出来才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你的协助，执行者费德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的机动性不弱，我虽然勉强追到这里，但还是追丢了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你居然没有立刻回复？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很少见哦，你这样子我会觉得是出了什么大事......欸，你皱眉了，所以真的出了什么大事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有琴声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"琴声？有......吗？我好像没有听到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我推断，琴声是从顶层圣堂的方向传来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说呢，这段时间以来我对你在公证所的工作多少有所了解，因此我会比较信任你的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我正式地询问你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中庭公证所执行者费德里科，你真的认为这段来源不明，不确定影响，甚至有可能全然无害的琴声——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会比我向你提出的协助请求更加重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"显而易见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"琴声的出现是偶然事件，我对此有所怀疑，但不可否认的是，暂时找不到其与目前发生的所有事件之间的直接关联。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据目前的形势判断，应优先执行协助任务，与你共同行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，不继续说下去了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我可没有要欺负人的意思。只不过，我也确实需要确认一下你的态度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我指一个方向，我继续追踪目标，琴声的事就交给你来解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......本次任务需要优先确保你和奥伦的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽职尽责是好事，但是我觉得优先度这种东西，是要自己判断的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受不到你的情绪，费德里科。不过，我有一个黎博利朋友，因为无法和她共感，所以我早早学会了如何猜测他人的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然她比你好懂很多，但有些东西是共通的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个小小的忠告——或许有的时候，你得学会相信你的直觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这么定了，我们没有多少时间可以浪费......我也得强迫自己活动一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出发，大家行动起来~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g8_outsidepath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加快速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科先生！请、请等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面到底......到底有什么？只是琴声而已，而且现在已经听不到了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们、我们真的就让那位小姐一个人去冒险吗？她还坐着轮椅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能不担心？我刚刚看到了......那是个怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安由第七厅枢机亲自邀请加入教皇厅，实力不容小觑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太明白这些，也就是说，那位小姐也是很厉害的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......万一呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加快速度。或者留在原地等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建议你选择后者。这是更安全的选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（没有人？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不对。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"细微的声响在空旷的圣堂内荡开，铳上膛的声音与其同步响起。\n执行者猛然举起铳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只会再警告一次。从那里出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......被找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被找到了。和姐姐说的一样呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，大哥哥一下就找到我们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的、真的是姐姐说的那个大哥哥吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翅膀和圈圈都黑黑的，应该没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥哥，我的名字叫作艾伦戴尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫艾丝塔拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你们提到我的人在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥哥，看起来好凶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好凶哦！而且大哥哥都不说自己的名字......没有礼貌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈说过，不可以回答不知道名字的陌生人的问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凶凶的费德里科哥哥，是好人吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定是好人！就像故事里说的那样~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那可以说了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人告诉我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们在这里等一个凶巴巴的，和她一样头顶有黑色圈圈的大哥哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说、还说大哥哥会带我们找到妈妈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啦！姐姐还说，我们只能等一小会，就一会会！如果大哥哥不来的话，我们就要自己跑出去~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......姐姐说不能一直待在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说、还说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_